            "review_title": "Review at Kaiserkaffee Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Uwe Z\n1 contribution\n0\nA beautiful successful evening\nFeb 2025 • Family\nMy Vietnamese wife, me as a German and another 8 family members spent a nice evening in Kaiserkaffee.\nWe all liked it very much. Paulaner beer, ribs, ice cream and other food were tasty and sufficient.\nMy wish for an extra portion of fries could not be fulfilled, as a substitute I got fried potatoes as I know them from home.\nAnd also the price was acceptable,\n10 people converted into € - 200€, 20€ per person (food and drinks)\nWe stayed separately in the 1. Upstairs in one room, with toilet in the next room.\nThe only reason to complain was the door of the toilet, which did not close properly.\nAs in Vietnam Standard, you could log into the Internet with a Wi-Fi password, and with an app for translating, I could also talk to the waiter, as he could only speak a few words in German.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from German\nShow original\nWritten February 11, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
