            "review_text": "Global_Citizen_YK\nLondon, United Kingdom264 contributions\n0\nA place to be AVOIDED\nDec 2024 • Friends\nHaving read some positive reviews, we decided to visit this German restaurant. As the ground floor was full we were shown to a first floor side-room, rather badly ventilated, where another couple were seated. As soon as we got our drinks the gentleman started smoking his cigar. We told the waiter that it is against their own no smoking policy and we couldn’t eat there so we were shown another room next door. That room was not in use and was rather warm. Our food arrived and all I can say, it was very soggy and tasteless, “Vienna schnitzel with a minimalistic portion of fries”. Not an enjoyable evening and certainly NOT a place to be further recommended.\nRead more\nWritten December 7, 2024",
