            "review_text": "hannostamm\nSiem Reap, Cambodia1028 contributions\n0\nGerman canteen food from the 60's\nJul 2017 • Solo\nThe food is just as I remember it when I was a young kid: uninspired, bland, with a minimum of garnish. The food wasn't bad per se, but German cuisine has evolved somewhat more since the Berlin wall came down.\n\nService was friendly enough and they had a good selection of beer, but the beer could have been colder.\n\nIn 22 years in Vietnam, this was my first German food in Ha Noi, and it might also be the last time.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 16, 2017",
