            "review_text": "twooldfarts\nHua Hin, Thailand81 contributions\n0\nLovely furniture, dreadful food and service\nFeb 2017 • Friends\nWe looked on trip advisor for a German restaurant as my husband loves German wheat beer and found this one. The service was rude and unfriendly and we should have had a drink and left but we were on our way to the theatre so time was short to find somewhere lease at short notice. My husband ordered BBQ pork chop with homefried potatoes and got snitzel and sauté potatoes and I ordered mixed salad and baked potato. I had finished the salad by the time the potato arrived which was 2 balls of mashed potato. We thought it was the worst food we have ever had in Hanoi and won't be going back. Our advice is - avoid it at all costs!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 28, 2017",
