            "review_text": "Mr_Miagi1986\nGrossostheim, Germany13 contributions\n1\nGreat German restaurant near Hoan Kiem Lake\nMay 2013 • Friends\nExcellent german restaurant near the Oldtown. Great service, quality food and beers are excellent value. They have all kind of imported beer from all over the globe. It's that place to be if you want to have a wiener schnitzel and a nice erdinger wheat beer. The ambiente and charm is so suprising once u make ur way across the small alley. rustical wood with all kind of decoration from germany. It does feel like home. Been there a couple of times as i am living in Hanoi right now. Can highly recommend this place, come and check it out yourself!!!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 23, 2013",
